  "readmeFile": "docs\\README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "UX & stability improvements, bug fixes\n- #175: Each connection now shows its own SDK messages. After changing connection, or with the tool open in two tabs, the step editor used to offer the messages of the first environment (thanks @WebbontheWeb)\n- #175: Refresh (F5) retries a failed load, and a failed refresh keeps the current tree instead of closing the connection\n- #175: Registration commands are disabled while the organization is loading\n- #175: Editing a step whose message isn't available, such as a private message, explains why instead of failing\n\nSecurity\n- #178: Removed the unused System.Security.Cryptography.Pkcs reference, which had two denial-of-service advisories (GHSA-846f-f764-76mx, GHSA-2fmv-rv2c-59x7)",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
